<div class="days">


<div class="day">

<div class="day-head">
<span class="day-name">MONDAY</span>
</div>

<h3>4×4 Assault Bike + Upper</h3>

<p>
10 min warm-up →
<span class="pace">4×4 min hard</span> →
3 min easy between →
8 min cooldown.
</p>

<p class="details">
Upper strength 40–50 min.
Hard but controlled; no need to sprint the final rep.
</p>

</div>



<div class="day">

<div class="day-head">
<span class="day-name">TUESDAY</span>
</div>

<h3>Upper + Light Legs</h3>

<p>
Split squat 2×8/side ·
step-down 2×10/side ·
calf 3×12.
</p>

<p class="details">
RPE ~6. Keep 3–4 reps in reserve.
No soreness chasing.
</p>

</div>



<div class="day">

<div class="day-head">
<span class="day-name">WEDNESDAY</span>
</div>

<h3>Easy Aerobic — 60 min</h3>

<p class="pace">
5:00–5:25/km
</p>

<p class="details">
Conversational throughout.
Keep it genuinely easy.
</p>

</div>



<div class="day">

<div class="day-head">
<span class="day-name">THURSDAY</span>
</div>

<h3>Full Body + Heavy Legs</h3>

<p>
Squat/leg press 3×5 ·
RDL 3×5 ·
split squat 2×6/side +
upper accessories.
</p>

<p class="details">
~2 reps in reserve.
Heavy, but low volume.
</p>

</div>



<div class="day key">

<div class="day-head">
<span class="day-name">FRIDAY</span>
<span class="badge">Key Run</span>
</div>

<h3>3×8 min Threshold</h3>

<p>
2 km easy →
<span class="pace">3×8 min @ 4:18–4:22/km</span> →
2 min jog recoveries →
2 km easy.
</p>

<p class="details">
≈10–11 km total.
Controlled threshold, not racing.
</p>

</div>



<div class="day">

<div class="day-head">
<span class="day-name">SATURDAY</span>
</div>

<h3>Rest / Easy Hike</h3>

<p>
Rest preferred.
Alternatively 45–90 min easy hiking.
</p>

</div>



<div class="day">

<div class="day-head">
<span class="day-name">SUNDAY</span>
</div>

<h3>Long Run — 15 km</h3>

<p class="pace">
4:55–5:20/km
</p>

<p class="details">
Easy throughout.
</p>

</div>


</div>

<div class="week-total">
≈42 km running
</div>

