<footer>

<div class="note">

<strong>How to use this plan</strong>

<br><br>

Easy = conversational.<br>
Steady = controlled aerobic.<br>
Threshold = hard but repeatable.<br>
HM = 4:02/km.

<br><br>

The plan is built from a 1:27:35 benchmark and aims to make
1:25 pace familiar without requiring you to race every workout.
If current fitness has materially changed, adjust paces rather
than forcing the numbers.

<br><br>

<strong>ITB:</strong>
if pain escalates, changes your running mechanics,
or persists/worsens, stop the session and reassess rather than
pushing through it.

</div>

